-----------------------------------------
MODIFIED FILES


    amr_parameters.f90:
    - added output parameter 'output_dir' (type character(len=80))
     which allows to redirect the output to any location


    init_amr.f90:
    - added TRIM(output_dir) to strings fileloc;
     look for 'output_'//TRIM(nchar)


    movie.f90:
    - added TRIM(output_dir) to string moviedir
     look for 'output_'//TRIM(nchar)


    output_amr.f90:
    - added TRIM(output_dir) to filedir
     look for 'output_'//TRIM(nchar)
    - added afer line 'call backup_part(filename, filename_desc)' the following:
        if(sink)then
           filename=TRIM(filedir)//'sink_'//TRIM(nchar)//'.csv'
           call output_sink_csv(filename)
        end if


    units.f90:
    - added factG_in_cgs, M_sun, Myr2sec, kpc2cm from amr/constants.f90
    - added hydro, mass_sph from hydr/hydro_parameters.f90
    - added new variables:
        real(dp)::scale_m
        real(dp),parameter::km2cm=1.0d+5
        logical,save::first_call=.true.
    - automatically set scale_t when poisson=.true. to ensure that G=1 in user units for all gravity runs
    - added:
        ! mass conversion factor
        scale_m = scale_d * scale_l**3
    - added an output block with relevant scaling information
